---
import { url } from '../lib/url';
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="imc-footer">
  <div class="imc-footer__top">
    <div class="max-w-[340px]">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-3.5">
        <div class="imc-footer-logo">異</div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-white text-sm font-bold m-0">이능관리위원회</p>
          <p class="text-[10px] text-[#888] font-serif mt-0.5 m-0">異能管理委員會</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="text-[11px] leading-relaxed m-0">
        (00000) 서울특별시 종로구 ○○로 ○○ (가상)<br />
        대표전화 1551-0000 · FAX 02-XXX-XXXX<br />
        사업자등록번호 ○○○-○○-○○○○○
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="imc-footer__cols">
      <div>
        <p class="imc-footer__col-title">정책·제도</p>
        <div class="imc-footer__links">
          <a href={url('about/')}>등재 안내</a>
          <a href={url('about/')}>매칭 시스템</a>
          <a href={url('faq/')}>차출 제도</a>
          <a href={url('faq/')}>안정원 안내</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="imc-footer__col-title">정보공개</p>
        <div class="imc-footer__links">
          <a href={url('resources/')}>법령·규정</a>
          <a href={url('resources/')}>통계 자료실</a>
          <a href={url('resources/')}>백서·간행물</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="imc-footer__col-title">민원·고객</p>
        <div class="imc-footer__links">
          <a href={url('faq/')}>자주 묻는 질문</a>
          <a href={url('registration/')}>민원 신청</a>
          <a href={url('faq/')}>신고 센터</a>
          <a href={url('faq/')}>상담 문의</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="imc-footer__bottom">
    <div class="imc-footer__legal">
      <a href={url('about/')} class="text-white font-bold">개인정보처리방침</a>
      <span>이용약관</span>
      <span>저작권 정책</span>
      <span>이메일 무단수집 거부</span>
      <span>웹 접근성</span>
    </div>
    <p class="m-0 font-mono text-[#666] tracking-wide">
      © {year} POWER MANAGEMENT COMMITTEE · ALL RIGHTS RESERVED
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
